# index.html hero description
msgid "Mazkur nashr arxitektura, shaharsozlik, bino va inshootlar qurilishi, geodeziya, kartografiya hamda davlat kadastri tizimlarida olib borilayotgan fundamental va amaliy tadqiqotlarning samaradorligini oshirishni maqsad qilgan. Shuningdek, zamonaviy ta'lim metodologiyasini takomillashtirish, tarmoqqa raqamli texnologiyalar, BIM (Building Information Modeling) tizimlari hamda sun'iy idrok algoritmlarini chuqur integratsiya qilish masalalariga bag'ishlangan yuqori salohiyatli tahliliy ma'lumotlar va innovatsion yechimlar manbaidir."
msgstr "This publication aims to increase the efficiency of fundamental and applied research in the fields of architecture, urban planning, construction of buildings and structures, geodesy, cartography, and state cadastre systems. It is also a source of high-potential analytical data and innovative solutions dedicated to improving modern educational methodology and deeply integrating digital technologies, BIM (Building Information Modeling) systems, and artificial intelligence algorithms into the industry."

msgid "'Arxitektura va Ta'lim' Ilmiy-Elektron Jurnali"
msgstr "\"Architecture and Education\" Scientific-Electronic Journal"

# about.html
msgid "TIFT 'Arxitektura va Ta'lim' ilmiy-elektron jurnali"
msgstr "TIFT \"Architecture and Education\" scientific-electronic journal"

msgid "Yiliga chop etiladi"
msgstr "Published annually"

msgid "Bepul kirish"
msgstr "Free access"

msgid "Yo'nalishlar"
msgstr "Directions"

msgid "Tahririyat a'zolari"
msgstr "Editorial Board Members"

msgid "Tahririyat a'zolari hali qo'shilmagan."
msgstr "Editorial board members have not been added yet."

msgid "Barcha yuborilgan maqolalar ikki tomonlama ko'r taqriz jarayonidan o'tadi. Ko'rib chiqish muddati 4-6 hafta. Muallif va taqrizchi bir-birini bilmaydi."
msgstr "All submitted articles go through a double-blind peer review process. The review period is 4-6 weeks. The author and reviewer do not know each other."

msgid "\"Arxitektura va Ta'lim\" ilmiy-elektron jurnali Toshkent Xalqaro Moliyaviy Boshqaruv va Texnologiyalar Universiteti (TIFT) tomonidan nashr etiladi. Jurnal arxitektura, qurilish, geodeziya, kartografiya, kadastr va ta'lim sohasidagi ilmiy-amaliy tadqiqotlarni chop etishga ixtisoslashgan."
msgstr "The scientific-electronic journal \"Architecture and Education\" is published by the Tashkent International University of Financial Management and Technologies (TIFT). The journal specializes in publishing scientific and practical research in the fields of architecture, construction, geodesy, cartography, cadastre, and education."

